  $: CLOSEUP - AN ACE OF SPADES PLAYING CARD ON PATTERNED CARPET

  [[show backdrop colorscript_002]] [[show backdrop colorscript_003 after 1]]
  We hear the chime of slot machines.

  The rattle of plastic chips.   The bustle of patrons.

  A muffled cry.   Heels dragging carpet.   Farther.   Farther --

  A GUN.   In the hands of an amateur.   Their white gloves tremble around the grip.

  They shout toward the struggle in the distance --

  THE GLOVED FIGURE:
    LET HER GO!

  A GIRL BESIDE:
    What are you doing!!?

  Her hands fly in from the side.   Clamp the gun.   Pry.   Twist.   Wrench.

  ((stop music mus_i_group)) ((stop music temp_sfx_gallery)) ((sfx_guns_firing))
  **BA-BANG.**

  Overhead,  a CHAIN snaps.

  She screams in pain.   Before it can carry,  it's drowned by a ((sfx_chandelier)) DEAFENING CRASH.

  ((m_todo_crowd_stampede)) Panic.   Pandemonium.   _A stampede_.

  Through the haze -- one glimpse of her\:  Down on one knee.
  Red runs between her fingers.

  [[show backdrop colorscript_004]]
  A bead of red taps the card.

  Then another.

  It spreads.

  [[show backdrop colorscript_005]]
