  [[show backdrop colorscript_028]]
  A young man (age 18) looks up from a small leather notebook --

  $: INT. DORM BEDROOM

  [[show backdrop colorscript_029]]
  He scans the room.   It's dark and quiet.

  [[show backdrop colorscript_030]]
  The rainstorm outside batters against his window.

  [[show backdrop colorscript_029]] He sighs and reaches for an eraser,  when --

  ((m_todo_sfx_shingle_clattering)) A CLATTER.

  He freezes.

  His eyes flick to the curtains -- shut tight.

  [[show backdrop colorscript_031]]
  On his desk,  a clock reads\:

  \   **3:00AM**

  [[show backdrop colorscript_030]]
  ((m_todo_sfx_shingle_clattering_breaks)) MORE CLATTERING.   Back at the window.

  [[show backdrop colorscript_031]]
  He leans in.   Reaches for the curtains...

  [[show backdrop colorscript_032]] [[show backdrop colorscript_033 after 1]]
  He ((sfx_curtain_swish)) draws them open to reveal --

  [[show backdrop colorscript_034]] ((sfx_thunder)) ((play music mus_i_group))
  _A FIGURE STANDING JUST OUTSIDE_.

  [[show backdrop colorscript_035 after 1]]
  The young man REELS.

  [[show backdrop colorscript_036]]
  The figure stands silhouetted in the moonlight -- facing the night sky.

  They start to take a step _toward the edge_.

  [[show backdrop colorscript_037]]
  The young man ((m_todo_sfx_bang_scramble)) SCRAMBLES across his desk.   ((sfx_window_throw_open)) ((play ambient sfx_amb_rain_outdoors)) [[show backdrop colorscript_038 after 1]] [[show backdrop colorscript_039 after 1]] THROWS OPEN the window.   REACHES through the wind and rain.

  [[show backdrop colorscript_040]]
  He ((sfx_hand_grabbing_sleeve)) CATCHES the arm of the figure.

  [[show backdrop colorscript_041]] [[show backdrop colorscript_042 after 1]]
  The figure tries to turn.   But ((sfx_shoes_squeaking)) they lose their footing instead -- they SLIP and start ((m_todo_rooftile_slide)) sliding down the slanted roof.

  [[show backdrop colorscript_044]]
  The young man ((sfx_hand_tightening_grip)) TIGHTENS HIS GRIP.   [[show backdrop colorscript_045 after 1]] His knees ((m_todo_scrape_wood_against_floor)) SCRAPE PAINFULLY across the desk as he's WRENCHED forward.

  [[show backdrop colorscript_046]]
  ((sfx_bang_crash)) BANG.  His stomach meets the windowsill.
  He GASPS and winces but his grip STAYS FIRM.

  [[show backdrop colorscript_047]]
  He hangs halfway out the window -- a torrent of rain thundering around him,  drenching him to the waist.

  [[show backdrop colorscript_048]]
  He shakes the hair from his eyes.   Looks down.

  [[show backdrop colorscript_049]]
  The figure desperately clutches his arm -- eyes wide behind a MASQUERADE MASK -- expression a strange mix of gratitude and uncertainty.

  [[show backdrop colorscript_050]]
  The young man stares at the boy dangling in his grasp -- several stories above certain death.

  [[show backdrop colorscript_051]]
