scene ACT_ONE

  # ActOne

  ^: _ACT ONE_

  ## Setup

  ^: ***5 YEARS LATER...***

  [[show backdrop closeup_printer_sketch]]

  ((play music mus_l_group))
  ((play ambient sfx_amb_rain_indoors))

  $: CLOSEUP - PAPER STUTTERING FORWARD

  ((play environmental sfx_printer_whirring loop))

  LOUD WHIRRING.   A printer arm sweeps back and forth.   Incredibly slowly.

  BUNNY:
    C'mon.      
    <p:2>::C'moooon...::

  The printer falters to a stop with a loud [[animate stage with shake]]::CRUNCH::.((sfx_printer_jam)) ((stop environmental sfx_printer_whirring))

  BUNNY:
    Nonono--  Not now!

  Camera pulls back to reveal...

  [[show backdrop bg_print_shop]]

  $: INT. PRINT SHOP - LATE AFTERNOON

  A young man wrenches at the jammed paper.

  This is "BUNNY" -- our dorm-room occupant from earlier (now age 23).

  Strong-willed.   And a bit neurotic.

  He's got that Jersey snap and a prickly disposition that doesn't seem to match the nickname --

  Far more bristle than fluff.

  // todo replace bunny_angry with bunny_realization with the bunny_angry face
  BUNNY:
    (straining)
    ((sfx_bang_smack))
    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ...would'ya let go already...

  The paper doesn't budge.

  Behind the counter,  a bored ATTENDANT lifts one side of his headphones --

  // todo animate letters falling into place on UI for sarcasm/annoyance
  ATTENDANT:
    Sir,  please step away from the printer.

  Bunny tugs the paper one last time,  ((sfx_paper_tear))::RIPPING:: it in half.

  He waves the torn page at the attendant --

  BUNNY:
    Look,  I really,  <p:3>::really::   <p:1>gotta print this thing...

  ATTENDANT:
    Nah...   Looks busted.

  BUNNY:
    Well's there any way you could--

  ((play environmental sfx_phone_ringtone loop))
  A RINGTONE cuts him off.   He glances at the caller ID\:

  \    **Maria Manders**

  Bunny holds up a finger and pivots away.

  The attendant returns his attention to a magazine and loudly chews a stick of gum.

  ((sfx_phone_beep1))
  ((stop environmental sfx_phone_ringtone))
  BEEP.

  Bunny places his phone on a nearby table --

  BUNNY:
    (futzing in the printer)
    Hey now's not a great ti--

  MRS. MANDERS:
    (on speakerphone)
    Hi stranger!!   It's been a while! >
    How's the city?   
    You know I heard... >
    (loudly sings)
    ~~<p:4>If  <p:3>you  <p:2>can~   <p:9>MAKE IT  <p:5>THERE~!~~   
    ~~<p:4>You'll  <p:2>make it~   <p:8>ANYWH--~~

  ((sfx_bang_smack)) Bunny snatches the phone and ((sfx_phone_beep2)) switches it off speaker.

  The attendant snorts.

  // todo bunny_resigned~phone
  BUNNY:
    (under his breath)
    Mom, please...

  MRS. MANDERS (49, bubbly, affectionate) carries on,  chipper\:

  MRS. MANDERS:
    So your Tita called the ~~other day~ ~~ >
    Jason passed the NCLEX -- First try! >
    Did you see?   
    I sent it on your socials.

  // todo bunny_avoidant
  BUNNY:
    (with a strained smile)
    Nope...   must'a missed that...

  MRS. MANDERS:
    (sing-song)
    ~~*Alam mo yun~*~~   
    Even if medical school didn't work out,  there's always ~~nursing~... ~~

  Bunny sighs and pulls the phone from his ear --

  // todo Face Variant - guilty/embarrassed smile
  BUNNY:
    (to the attendant)
    So uh... since this thing jammed,  could you--

  Without looking up,  the attendant ((sfx_gum_pop))::pops:: his gum and points to the sign above his head\:

  \    **"_NO REFUNDS_"**

  // todo bunny_resigned
  BUNNY:
    Right.   
    ...Of course.

  Bunny stuffs the ripped pages in his bag and returns the phone to his ear.

  MRS. MANDERS:
    ...not as <p:1>*exciting* <p:0>as making movies...

  He trudges to the shop entrance.

  MRS. MANDERS:
    ...*pero* good benefits,  
    job security...

  Opens the door.

  MRS. MANDERS:
    ...and just <p:1>a few months <p:0>of...

  ((sfx_thunder))
  ((fade music mus_l_piano+mus_l_tenor_sax to 0 over 0.5))
  ((play ambient sfx_amb_rain_outdoors))
  [[animate stage with shake]]
  _It's POURING rain_.

  From outside\: Bunny,  framed in the doorway as Mrs. Manders continues -- incomprehensible over the downpour.

  Back inside -- Bunny sucks in a shaky breath,  through gritted teeth.

  He glances down at an umbrella stand next to the door.

  Inside is A SINGLE UMBRELLA -- bearing a familiar UGLY LOGO.

  The same logo on the attendant's headphones.

  Bunny eyes the rude attendant,  still flipping through the magazine.

  Bunny turns back to the stand.

  ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_crime_motif_1))
  CLOSE ON the umbrella...  HOLD.

  %: HARD CUT TO:

  ((sfx_thunder))
  ((fade music mus_l_piano+mus_l_tenor_sax to 1 over 0.5))
  [[show backdrop bg_bunnys_ext_neighbourhood_rainy]]

  $: EXT. RAINY SIDEWALK

  Bunny hustles through the downpour,  shielding his head with his JACKET.

  He has his phone tucked precariously between his shoulder and cheek --

  MRS. MANDERS:
    ...and giving up so soon,  after all those loans--

  His other hand flips through a familiar LEATHER POCKET NOTEBOOK\:

  \    **_March 15th_**   \
  \    **[X] Final edits**  \
  \    **[X] Print pitch packet**   \
  \    **[ ] Get changed**  \
  \    **[ ] _PITCH MEETING:_ 7PM**   \

  \    **_To-Do:_**   \
  \    **[ ] Call mom**   \
  \    **[ ] Research**   \
  \    **[ ] PAY RENT**

  Struggling to keep the jacket in place,  he fishes out a pen and ((sfx_helmet_click)) uncaps it with his teeth --

  BUNNY:
    (mumbled around the cap)
    Ma, I'll take care of it,  
    trust me.

  He ((sfx_pencil_scribble_checkmark)) crosses off **"Call mom"**.

  BUNNY:
    I just need to--

  Bunny ((sfx_shoes_stopping)) stops mid-stride.

  CLOSEUP - **[ ] PAY RENT**

  [[show backdrop bg_bunnys_ext_apartment_note]]

  He looks up at his apartment.

  The cap falls from his mouth.

  // closeup
  ((sfx_emotional_problem_rev_0)) There's a PADLOCK and a NOTE on his door --

  // todo make face more exasperated
  BUNNY:
    <p:6>No <p:6>No <p:6>No.

  He pockets the notebook.   Runs up.   [[show backdrop bg_bunnys_ext_apartment_no_note]] ((sfx_paper_crinkle)) Rips off the EVICTION NOTICE.

  He reads the message scrawled across the top\:

  \    **"No money.   No entry.   No more second chances."**

  // todo eyes should face downward and be more angry
  BUNNY:
    (at the note)
    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
    Seriously???

  MRS. MANDERS:
    ...*ano yun*...?   ...bad connection...

  BUNNY:
    Sorry,  it's just...

  He repositions the phone and ((sfx_lock_jostle)) YANKS on the padlock --

  // todo eye's should be pointing down, ideally hand forward interacting with the door
  BUNNY:
    (straining)
    I'm a little busy right now--

  MRS. MANDERS:
    Busy?   With work?

  He bolts to the window.

  BUNNY:
    (jostling the window)
    ((sfx_window_jostle)) Somethin' like that! >
    I got this big meeting soon and--

  MRS. MANDERS:
    (surprised)
    Meeting?  You got the job already?

  [[show backdrop bg_bunnys_int_apartment]]

  He peers inside --

  BUNNY:
    I mean, I'm meeting producers to--

  MRS. MANDERS:
    (delighted)
    *Ay*, thank the Lord~! >
    What did I say,  *ha*?   
    And you were so worried!

  Bunny spots his one and only suit hanging from the shower curtain that separates his bathroom/toilet from his kitchen/bedroom.

  [[show backdrop bg_bunnys_ext_apartment_no_note]]

  BUNNY:
    Yeah... >
    ((colin_todo_sfx_emotional_sigh)) Really livin' the dream...

  MRS. MANDERS:
    (excited)
    Well I won't keep you!   
    Get there early!   
    And wear that suit I bought you.

  He starts pacing --

  MRS. MANDERS:
    And a nice tie.  Nothing too bright. >
    *Ano kasi*...   you don't want them thinking you're--

  Bunny [[animate stage with shake]] ((sfx_bang_kick)) kicks the wall under his window.

  He hisses and kneels,  clutching his foot.

  MRS. MANDERS:
    *Anak*?

  BUNNY:
    (straightening painfully)
    [[animate stage with shake]] ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack)) <p:2>YES!!   [[animate stage with shake]] ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack)) Okay!!   [[animate stage with shake]] ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack)) Got it!   [[animate stage with shake]] ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack)) Thanks!<p:1>

  MRS. MANDERS:
    (proudly)
    *Ooo~ ang anak ko ay magiging* ~~movie star~!~~

  // todo fix crosseyed bunny
  BUNNY:
    ...writer...   movie writer...

  Bunny looks at the ground.

  He's knocked something loose.

  ((colin_todo_sfx_emotional_questioning+temp_sfx_realization))
  ((fade music mus_l_piano+mus_l_tenor_sax to 0 over 0.5))
  A BRICK.

  He picks it up.

  WIDE ON Bunny.   Rising.   Brick in hand.

  ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_crime_motif_2)) He turns toward the locked window.   HOLD...

  HOLD...

  HOLD. . .

  %: HARD CUT TO:

  $: BRICK BACK IN WALL - RIGHT WHERE HE FOUND IT

  ((sfx_puddle_splash))
  ((fade music mus_l_piano+mus_l_tenor_sax to 1 over 0.5))
  A crummy bicycle wheel rolls past the bricks.

  [[show backdrop bg_bunnys_ext_neighbourhood_rainy]]

  ((play environmental sfx_amb_biking))
  Bunny wraps his jacket over his helmet and tucks the sleeves into the straps.

  It doesn't shield him from the rain as much as he hoped.

  Bunny hops on his bike.

  BUNNY:
    Look,  I gotta go.

  MRS. MANDERS:
    *Sige, sige*...   
    One more thing!

  Bunny starts to pedal --

  BUNNY [<]:
    Ma, I really--

  MRS. MANDERS [>]:
    Are you coming home for Easter?

  Bunny ((sfx_bike_skid)) ((stop environmental sfx_amb_biking)) jerks to a halt.   His jacket flops over his face.

  MRS. MANDERS [<]:
    (hopefully)
    *Kasi* your birthday's that weekend so I was thinking--

  BUNNY [>]:
    (too loud)
    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
    --I'm busy!

  Bunny wrenches the jacket away.

  He winces --

  BUNNY:
    (lying)
    I mean,  I'll ::be:: busy...

  He shifts.

  BUNNY:
    (lying badly)
    ((colin_todo_sfx_emotional_guilty+temp_sfx_realization))
    ((fade music mus_l_piano+mus_l_tenor_sax+mus_l_bass+mus_l_bongos to 0 over 0.5))
    Probably...

  Rain fills the silence.

  BUNNY:
    Mom?

  MRS. MANDERS:
    (trying to stay cheerful)
    *Oo naman syempre*!  I understand.

  A beat.

  Bunny looks down.

  MRS. MANDERS:
    (hesitant)
    *Anak*...

  Her voice sounds far away...

  MRS. MANDERS:
    You know I'm always here... >
    <!>(beat)
    ...if you ever need me.

  Bunny adjusts his grip on the bike handles --

  BUNNY:
    I-I know...

  Silence.

  He dons his jacket --

  BUNNY:
    Bye Ma.

  Mounts his bike.

  And after a moment,  adds --

  BUNNY:
    (with difficulty)
    Love you.

  A beat.

  MRS. MANDERS:
    (quickly)
    And remember for your outfit,  
    nothing too--!

  He hangs up with a ((sfx_phone_beep3)) ((stop music mus_l_group)) CLICK.

  %: CUT TO:
  ((play music mus_c_group))
  ## Catalyst

  $: EXT. L TRAIN STATION - 6:40PM

  FROM A DISTANCE -- Bunny dismounts.   Dumps his shitty-bike at the rack.   Doesn't chain it.   Doesn't care.

  He ((sfx_helmet_click)) unsnaps his helmet and descends into the station.

  ((play ambient sfx_amb_subway))
  [[show backdrop bg_subway_interior]]

  $: INT. SUBWAY ENTRANCE

  A train rumbles below.   The wet air pushes up through the grates -- steel,  urine,  pretzel grease.

  Bunny taps his card ((sfx_electronic_error)) and dashes through the turnstile --

  [[animate stage with shake]]
  ((sfx_bang_crash))
  _The bar DOESN'T GIVE_.

  He clutches his bruised stomach and backs away.

  Turnstile reads\:

  \    **Insufficient Funds:**  \
  \    **Please reload card.**

  ((play sound sfx_running))

  A TEEN BOY swooshes past.

  He ((play sound sfx_jumping_turnstile)) VAULTS the bar and lands easy on the other side.

  He waves someone over --

  TEEN BOY:
    (shouting)
    Come on!

  ((sfx_running)) A TEEN GIRL skids to a stop at the bar.

  She glances toward a SECURITY CAMERA pointed in their direction.

  TEEN GIRL:
    What about--?

  The boy laughs.  Shakes his head.

  TEEN BOY:
    Camera's been busted for months!

  He grabs her hand and ((sfx_jumping_turnstile)) pulls her over.   Their laughter fades as they take off down the hall.

  ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_crime_motif_3))
  WIDE ON Bunny -- alone at the barrier.

  His eyes flick to the busted camera.

  To his right,  a clock on the wall\:

  \    **6:44 PM**

  HOLD on the turnstile...

  He wavers.

  Breathes in.

  Takes a hesitant step forward...

  [[animate stage with shake]]
  ((sfx_bang_crash_2))
  _And SOMEONE BOWLS INTO HIM FROM BEHIND_.

  The contents of Bunny's bag SPILL across the floor.

  PAPERS burst from the STRANGER's hands and flutter through the air.

  BUNNY:
    S-Sorry!

  The stranger blinks,  getting his bearings.

  He stands and starts to ((sfx_paper_shuffling)) gather his papers --

  STRANGER:
    My fault.   
    Didn't see you there.

  He tucks the stack under one arm,  and offers Bunny a hand --

  BUNNY:
    Thanks...

  The stranger helps Bunny up.   They look at each other.

  ((sfx_subway_announcement_1))
  BONG.   **THIS IS A MANHATTAN-BOUND L TRAIN.   PLEASE STAND CLEAR OF THE CLOSING DOORS** --

  Bunny glances at the clock and curses under his breath.

  He gathers ((sfx_paper_shuffling)) his things off the floor and stuffs them in his bag.

  The stranger nods and heads back to the turnstile.

  Then --

  Bunny stops.

  _Looks up_.

  The stranger is rounding the corner past the turnstile.   He's got a stack of papers tucked under his arm --

  A stack with the top page conspicuously ((sfx_emotional_problem)) _RIPPED IN HALF_.

  ## Debate

  BUNNY:
    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
    No No No!

  Bunny RUNS UP to the turnstile,  leaning over it as far as he can --

  BUNNY [<]:
    [[animate stage with shake]] ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack)) Hey wait!!  [[animate stage with shake]] ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack)) That's my--!

  ANNOUNCEMENT [>]:
    (BONG)
    ((sfx_subway_announcement_2 wait))
    ((stop music mus_c_group))
    **Remember to keep track of all belongings while riding the...**

  BUNNY:
    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
    Gah!

  ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_crime_motif_4))
  Bunny backs up and squares with the barrier.

  His eyes lock on the bar.

  Then finally...

  BUNNY:
    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((m_todo_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
