  ## ChoosingActTwo

  _Bunny JUMPS THE TURNSTILE_.

  ### RhythmMinigame1

  ^: <!>=== RHYTHM MINIGAME 1 BEGINS ===

  ^: <!>[GAMEPLAY\: Swipe left to move left,  Swipe right to move right]

  $: INT. SUBWAY HALLWAY - (MINIGAME 1A)

  ((play music mg1))
  MUSIC IS IN FULL SWING as Bunny sprints through the subway station -- WEAVING IN AND OUT of the crowd of commuters.

  He barrels toward the platform,   SCANNING through the crowd and subway car windows.

  THE STRANGER.   He's seated inside the middle car.

  ((sfx_subway_door_closing))
  A HISS of car doors closing.

  Bunny DUCKS INSIDE the nearest door.

  $: INT. SUBWAY CAR

  He PUSHES through the crowded car.   [[animate stage with shake]] ((sfx_bang_collide_nopaper)) BUMPS into someone.   They drop their PHONE --

  TEEN GIRL:
    Watch it!

  It's the teens from earlier.

  Bunny sputters apologies and fumbles for it.

  The car ROCKS.   He loses his balance.   ((sfx_phone_crunch)) STEPS ON IT instead.

  GLASS CRUNCHES as he lifts his foot.

  He sheepishly picks up the now shattered phone --

  BUNNY:
    (handing it over)
    ((colin_todo_emotional_embarrassed+temp_sfx_whoops))
    I am...  so sorry.

  TEEN GIRL:
    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((m_todo_emotional_anger+temp_sfx_smack))
    What the hell?!

  Bunny raises his hands and backs away.   Glances behind him.

  Can't see the stranger anymore.

  BUNNY:
    Look I'm sorry but--

  TEEN BOY:
    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((m_todo_emotional_anger+temp_sfx_smack))
    Yo, asshole!

  The teen boy behind her straightens and steps UP CLOSE.

  TEEN BOY:
    Gonna need more than an apology.

  BUNNY:
    Uh...

  Bunny _BOOKS IT through the crowd_.

  $: INT. SUBWAY CAR 2 - (MINIGAME 1B)

  Bunny dashes to the back car and looks around.

  ((sfx_subway_braking)) The train slows.   People start exiting.

  No sign of the stranger anywhere.

  Bunny looks out the window.   SPOTS HIM.

  He's making his way up the platform stairs and OUT OF THE STATION.

  The car doors start to close.

  TEEN BOY:
    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((m_todo_emotional_anger+temp_sfx_smack))
    Hey!

  Bunny FORCES his shoulder through the closing door and RUNS OUT.

  $: EXT. MANHATTAN SIDEWALK

  Bunny EXITS the station and frantically scans the street.

  ((play ambient sfx_amb_rain_outdoors))
  It's still POURING RAIN.

  THE STRANGER hails a YELLOW CAB and steps inside.

  Someone is stepping onto an ELECTRIC CITY SCOOTER.

  Bunny [[animate stage with shake]] ((sfx_bang_collide_nopaper)) SHOVES THEM OFF with an abrupt apology and HOPS ON.

  $: EXT. MANHATTAN STREET - (MINIGAME 1C)

  More DODGING pedestrians.   WEAVING through traffic.   RUNNING RED LIGHTS.

  All the while the scooter angrily BEEPS.

  Finally,  the cab comes to a halt.

  CLICK.   The scooter ((sfx_scooter_braking)) SHUTS OFF\:

  \    "RIDE CANCELED."

  choose
    + [Success!]
      _If player did well:_ Bunny manages to dismount somewhat impressively.

    + [Fail...]
      _If player did poorly:_ Bunny flies off the scooter and [[animate stage with shake]] ((sfx_bang_wipeout)) lands in a heap of garbage bags.
  then

    ((stop music mg1))
    ((sfx_amb_rain_outdoors))

    ^: <!>=== RHYTHM MINIGAME 1 ENDS ===

    [[show backdrop bg_raffles_ext_apartment_rainy]]

    From the sidewalk,  we pan up to...

    $: EXT. THE ALBANY LUXURY RESIDENCES

    Six stories of brownstone and bay windows on a block that used to live-and-die by bohemia.

    The artists got priced out years ago.   Nowadays it's mostly absentee LLCs.

    Bunny looks up.   The stranger is starting up the steps --

    BUNNY:
      (staggering after him)
      h-hey...!

    The stranger climbs the last step.

    Bunny ((sfx_bang_snatch)) CATCHES HIS ARM.

    [[animate screen with whitepulse]]
    ((sfx_flashback_transition wait))
    ((queue sound m_todo_sfx_flashback_motif))
    _INSERT - 5 YEARS AGO:_  A hand reaching out a window.   Shoes slipping on roof tiles.

    [[animate screen with whitepulse]]
    ((sfx_flashback_transition))
    _BACK TO SCENE_.

    IN SLOW MOTION  .  .  .  the stranger turns  .  .  .  and his eyes lock on--

    STRANGER?:
      ((colin_todo_sfx_emotional_realization+temp_sfx_realization))
      Bunny--?

    Polished shoes ((sfx_shoes_squeaking)) slip on wet concrete.

    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((sfx_bang_thunk))
    CRACK.   His head hits the banister.

    Bunny lurches forward and ((sfx_bang_body_on_couch_slow)) CATCHES HIM in his arms.

    His heartbeat thunders loudly in his ears.

    Bunny quickly lowers him to the ground.

    He lies motionless -- out cold -- dark curls spilling across his eyes.

    Shaky hands brush the locks aside.

    Bunny takes in the stranger's face --

    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((sfx_emotional_problem))
    _RAFFLES' face_.

    A face that's now [[animate stage with shake]] ((sfx_emotional_problem_2)) _bleeding_.

    ^: _END ACT ONE_

    -> ACT_TWO
  end
end

scene ACT_TWO

  # ActTwo

  ^: _ACT TWO_

  ## BStory

  [[hide backdrop]]

  $: BLACKNESS.

  ((m_todo_sfx_distorted_echoes)) Distorted echoes.   Like through a fog.

