    Are you alright?

  There's no response.

  BUNNY (O.S.):
    Raffles,  talk to me!

  Raffles pushes Bunny away --

  %: MATCH CUT TO:

  ((play music mus_e_group))

  [[show backdrop bg_raffles_int_apartment_evening_dim with pan_right]]
  [[animate stage with shake]]
  ((sfx_door_slam_open_rev_1))
  A SHOULDER SLAMS THROUGH THE ALBANY DOOR.

  $: INT. RAFFLES' APARTMENT - EVENING

  Bunny maneuvers backwards.   Panicked.   Arms dragging 180 pounds of dead weight -- Raffles.

  BUNNY:
    [[bunny_panicking~look_down]]
    (teeth clenched around a ring of keys)
