  // todo add pan across the apartment as Bunny runs back and forth
  For the first time,  we get a wide shot of Raffles' apartment as Bunny ((sfx_running)) tears through it -- desperately searching for anything resembling a first aid kit.

  ((sfx_rustle_cabinet))
  He tosses bits and bobs out of cabinets -- vintage books,  porcelain figures,  novelty lamps,  a grappling hook?

  It's like someone took an uptown penthouse and furnished it with the contents of a downtown thrift store.

  Bunny -- neck-deep in a bathroom cabinet.   Nothing.

  He shuts the door.

  BUNNY:
    [[bunny_serious]]
    (breathes)
    Right.   Okay.   Plan B.

  Bunny ((sfx_running)) cuts past a wall smothered in oil paintings and cuckoo clocks -- leaving a trail of muddy footprints in his wake.

  He returns with an armful of BEDSHEETS and a single BOTTLE OF WHISKEY precariously perched on top.

  ((m_todo_sfx_objects_clattering))
  He dumps the supplies in front of the sofa.

  He freezes.

  [[animate stage with shake]]
  ((sfx_emotional_problem_2))
  _The bleeding is getting worse_.

  He drops to his knees beside Raffles.

  BUNNY:
    [[bunny_panicking]]
