  Hands shaking,  Bunny pulls out his phone\:

  \    **1% BATTERY LEFT**

  He punches ((play sound sfx_phone_beep3)) ((play sound sfx_phone_beep2 after 0.3)) ((play sound sfx_phone_beep2 after 0.6)) 911.

  BUNNY:
    [[bunny_upset]]
    Raffles!   You can't die on me, okay?? >
    [[bunny_upset]]
    That's not allowed--

  ((sfx_phone_outgoing_call))
  RING RING.   Bunny grabs the BOTTLE.   ((sfx_bottle_open)) POPS it open with his teeth --

  BUNNY:
    [[bunny_panicattack]]
    'Cause what'll I tell the police?!

  ((sfx_phone_outgoing_call))
  RING RING.   He TIPS it.   ((sfx_bottle_pour)) POURS the whiskey over his hands --

  BUNNY:
    [[bunny_crazy]]
    "Officers!   I can explain!"

  ((sfx_phone_outgoing_call))
  RING RING.   He takes the BEDSHEET.   ((sfx_cloth_rip)) RIPS off a strip --

  BUNNY:
    [[bunny_crazy]]
    "See,  this was an accident." >
    [[bunny_crazy]]
    <!>(beat)
    ((colin_todo_sfx_emotional_manic)) "One 'a those typical,  every-day accidents where you ((colin_todo_sfx_emotional_extra_manic)) _stalk and assault your ex-boyfriend_!"

  ((sfx_phone_outgoing_call))
  RING RING.   Bunny ((sfx_bottle_pour)) DOUSES the strip with alcohol --

  BUNNY:
    [[bunny_stressed]]
    A-And you know I can't lie--  
    What would I say...? >
    [[bunny_crazy]]
    *"I found you like this?"* >
    [[bunny_crazy]]
    *"You fell down the stairs???"* >
    [[bunny_stressed_panicking]]
    They're gonna take me to court  and make me confess and   >
    [[bunny_stressed_panicking]]
    ((colin_todo_sfx_emotional_manic+temp_sfx_smack))
    _______what'll my mom think_______???

  ((sfx_phone_outgoing_call))
  RING RING.   Bunny lifts Raffles' hair --

  BUNNY:
    [[bunny_panicattack]]
    I can't come out to her _in prison_, Raffles! >
    [[bunny_panicattack]]
    She's got a heart thing!! >
    [[bunny_stressed_panicking]]
