  ((sfx_phone_outgoing_call))
  RING RING.   Seeing the blood again,  Bunny clamps his eyes shut and turns away.

  ((sfx_phone_outgoing_call))
  RING RING.   After taking a deep breath,  he turns back and presses the strip over the wound.

  He pauses to look down at the damage he's done.

  BUNNY:
