  ((colin_todo_emotional_realization+temp_sfx_realization))
  ((play music mus_e_alto_sax+mus_e_bari_sax+mus_e_bass_clarinet+mus_e_bass_flute+mus_e_tenor_sax+mus_e_trombone+mus_e_trumpet+mus_e_trumpet_2 mute))
  A hand GRABS Bunny's wrist.

  RAFFLES:
    // [[todo_raffles_weak]] barely conscious, raspy — head-wound woozy (lib has none)
    (raspy)
