  RAFFLES:
    // [[todo_raffles_groggy]] dazed, just came to
    (groggily)
    What time is it?

  BUNNY:
    [[bunny_what]]
    What time--? >
    [[bunny_angry]]
    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_whack))
    ::_RAFFLES_!::  
    *We gotta get you to a hospital!!*

  Raffles eases Bunny's hand off the cloth --

  RAFFLES:
    // [[todo_raffles_weak]] depleted, still woozy — easing hand off
    ...hate hospitals.

  He casually checks his watch --

  RAFFLES:
    [[raffles_serious]]
