  Raffles stands and sways,  steadying himself on Bunny's shoulder.

  He glances around his apartment and takes in the mess Bunny's made.

  RAFFLES:
    [[raffles_incredulous]]
    ((colin_todo_sfx_emotional_unimpressed+temp_sfx_whoops))
    Right.

  Raffles shakes his head --

  RAFFLES:
    [[raffles_confident]]
    It appears I'm *dreadfully* unprepared for guests,  so...

  He SPINS on his heel --

  ((fade music mus_e_bass_percussion+mus_e_bongos+mus_e_drums_cymbals+mus_e_drums_hihat+mus_e_drums_kick+mus_e_drums_snare+mus_e_drums_toms+mus_e_guiro+mus_e_maraca+mus_e_marimba+mus_e_piano+mus_e_xylophone to 0 over 2))

  RAFFLES:
    // [[todo_raffles_strained_cheer]] forced brightness masking injury
    ((colin_todo_sfx_emotional_strained_cheerful+temp_sfx_happyping))
