  ((fade music mus_e_group to 0 over 2))

  [[hide backdrop]]

  %: TIME CUT TO:
  ((stop music mus_e_group))

  ((play music mus_f_group))

  $: MUDDY BOOTS & SHOES LEFT NEAR THE ENTRANCEWAY

  A set of PLUSH SLIPPERS saunters into frame,  trailed by an anxious pair of DAMP BLUE SOCKS.

  BUNNY (O.S.):
    And you're sure you don't need to go to a hospital?

  We pan up to see Bunny -- in his rain-damp socks -- cradling a HEAVY CARDBOARD BOX.

  [[show backdrop bg_raffles_int_apartment_evening_bright with pan_right]]

  RAFFLES:
    (laughs)
    Yes yes,  I'm fine~

  This is A.J. RAFFLES (23) -- our masked figure from long ago.

  All bandage and bravado.   Raffles flits about the room,  humming to himself and basking in the glow of Bunny's undivided attention.

  He reaches for a small marble statue on the floor.

  Bunny crouches in front of him,  scanning his face.

  BUNNY:
    No dizziness?   
    Nausea?   
    Headache?

  Raffles smirks and shakes his head --

  RAFFLES:
    Nope.   Negative.   None of the above. >
    [[animate stage with shake]] ((sfx_bang_light_bat))

  Raffles bats Bunny's hand away.

  RAFFLES:
    Bunny, stop that! >
    Honestly.

  Raffles stands and arranges the statue above his fireplace --

  RAFFLES:
    It's just a scratch.   
    There's no need to fuss.

  BUNNY:
    (adjusting his grip on the box)
    B-but...  Well... >
    (mutters)
    ...in class,  they told us sometimes you can hit your head and feel fine... >
    (loudly)
    ((colin_todo_sfx_emotional_worried+temp_sfx_stab2))
    [[animate textbox with shake]]
    Then an artery bursts!! >
    And ya pass [[animate textbox with shake]] ((colin_todo_sfx_emotional_manic+temp_sfx_smack)) out--  
    And ya brain [[animate textbox with shake]] ((colin_todo_sfx_emotional_manic+temp_sfx_smack)) swells--  
    AND  YOU  [[animate textbox with shake]] ((colin_todo_sfx_emotional_extra_manic+temp_sfx_smack)) DIE!((stop music mus_f_group over 0.5))

  RAFFLES:
    (blinks)
    ... >
    (straightens)
    ...Right.

  ((play music mus_f_group over 1)) Raffles grabs the box from Bunny.

  RAFFLES:
    Might want to work on your bedside manner.

  He kneels,  gathering shreds of bloody bedsheet and ((m_todo_sfx_tossing_cloth)) tossing them in the box.

  BUNNY:
    Oh I'm not-- >
    Not anymore-- >
    (mumbles)
    ((colin_todo_sfx_emotional_embarrassed_mutter+temp_sfx_bvvt))
    ...I'dropped out...

  // ((TODO_DEFLATING))

  Raffles pauses and looks up at him.

  RAFFLES:
    Oh. >
    Sorry?

  BUNNY:
    (shrugs)
    'S fine.   I mean-- >
