  Raffles eyes him --

  RAFFLES:
    Yes... >

  Raffles stands,  hefting the box.

  RAFFLES:
    You know I seem to recall a ((colin_todo_sfx_emotional_teasing)) certain collision on the track field--

  BUNNY:
    ((colin_todo_sfx_emotional_embarrassed_mutter))
