  RAFFLES:
    (tsks)
    Oh Bunny... >
    My favorite cushions? >
    I really liked these.

  Raffles sighs and ((m_todo_sfx_tossing_cloth)) chucks it in the kitchen sink.

  RAFFLES:
    Alright.   
    No more med school:   \
    Noted.

  Raffles clears a space on the coffee table and sits,  crossing his legs --

  RAFFLES:
    So what do you do now?

  BUNNY:
    ((colin_todo_sfx_emotional_embarrassed_mutter+temp_sfx_bvvt))
