  RAFFLES:
    <!>(raising an eyebrow)
    ((colin_todo_sfx_emotional_pointed+temp_sfx_realization))
    ((fade music mus_f_bass+mus_f_bass_clarinet+mus_f_cello+mus_f_flute+mus_f_glock+mus_f_mellotron+mus_f_piano_melody+mus_f_rhodes_1+mus_f_rhodes_2+mus_f_viola+mus_f_piano to 0 over 0.5))
    Is it?

  A beat.

  Bunny turns face-down on the sofa.

  Raffles sits and places the cushion in his lap.

