  ### RhythmMinigame2

  ^: <!>=== RHYTHM MINIGAME 2 BEGINS ===

  $: INTERCUT IN/OUT OF CLOSET - (MINIGAME 2)

  ^: <!>[GAMEPLAY\:  Don't make a sound.  Tap-and-hold to catch falling items.]

  [[show backdrop bg_raffles_int_apartment_evening_bright with pan_right]]

  The detective makes her way past Raffles.

