  ((play music mus_h_group))
  ((sfx_door_close))
  _Crawshay SHUTS THE DOOR_.

  ^: <!>=== RHYTHM MINIGAME 2 ENDS ===

  Raffles and Mackenzie blink at him.

  Mackenzie looks at the door.

  She could make him open it.

  She doesn't.

  OFFICER CRAWSHAY:
