  choose
    + [Success!]
      _If player did well:_ Bunny manages to ((sfx_bang_catch_heavy)) catch the bag atop the pile of knick-knacks.

    + [Fail...]
      _If player did poorly:_ ((sfx_bang_wipeout)) The knick-knacks clatter to the floor as the bag knocks the wind out of him.
  then

    BUNNY:
