    %: CUT TO:

    $: EXT. ALLEYWAY - NIGHT

    ((play music mus_h_group))
    [[show backdrop bg_danbys_alleyway]]

    // new art needed - CLOSEUP - Bunny's phone (composing text + incoming messages)
    CLOSEUP - Bunny composing a text\: "What's plan b?"

    He's just about to hit send when another message covers the screen\:

    \    **(Maria Manders)\:**
    \    **remember its ok if the pay is a little low...**
    \    **you just have to get your foot in the door! :-)**
    \    **                  [Reply?]                     **

    Bunny flinches.  He stares at the message.

    His finger moves to the reply button...

    Hovers......

    Then swipes the message away.

    ((m_todo_sfx_phone_ping)) PING.

    RAFFLES (TEXT):
      up here!

    Bunny blinks and looks up.

    [[show backdrop bg_danbys_alleyway]]

    Raffles -- loafing on a second-floor windowsill -- flutters his fingers at him.

    Barely bothering to sit up,  he tips off the ledge.

    Bunny lurches into a run -- scrambling to get under him --

    ...but Raffles has already ((sfx_lightpole_slide)) caught a lamppost,  riding it round in one dramatic twirl to the pavement.

    Bunny's run dies mid-stride.

    Raffles lands and straightens,  dusting himself off --

    RAFFLES:
      What? >
      (shrugs)
      I do my own stunts.

    BUNNY:
      <!>(thrown)
      Right. >
      (pocketing his phone)
      Y'weren't kiddin' 'bout those "many talents".

    RAFFLES:
      Well I *may* have exaggerated one in particular...

    Raffles takes out his BROKEN LOCKPICK.

    BUNNY:
      That's...

    RAFFLES:
      Not good.   No.

    BUNNY:
      And I'm guessing...?

    RAFFLES:
      Nope.   No spares. >
      Not that it'd matter.  
      ((sfx_emotional_modest_embarrassed_rev_0))
      Never had much patience for lockpicking. >
      (nods)
      Drilling's much quicker.

    ((stop music mus_h_group))
    BUNNY:
      Right...

    // todo raffles face needs to look like he is suddenly remembering something

    ((play music mus_e_group mute))

    BUNNY [<]:
      (eyeing him)
      Wait hold on--

    RAFFLES [>]:
      [[animate stage with shake]]
      ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
      ((play music mus_e_bass+mus_e_marimba+mus_e_xylophone unmute))
      --DAMN!

    RAFFLES:
      (tapping his pockets)
      Left the drill in my other coat.

    BUNNY:
      (blinks)
      Um wh--

    RAFFLES:
      (mussing up his hair)
      [[animate stage with shake]]
      ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
      Gah! >
      (shutting his eyes)
      So stupid...

    BUNNY:
      Raffles...

    RAFFLES:
      [[animate stage with shake]]
      ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
      Shush, Bunny!   I can figure this out,  I just need--

    BUNNY:
      Raffles.

    RAFFLES:
      ((colin_todo_sfx_emotional_grrr))
      God, it's the one thing I--

    BUNNY:
      (grabbing his shoulders)
      [[animate stage with shake]]
      ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
      A.J.!

    Raffles looks up.

    BUNNY:
      <!>(gentle)
      It's okay.   It's _okay_...  
      Alright...? >
      <!>(beat)
      Look. >
      <!>(sincere)
      I appreciate the effort,  and the -- *frankly* -- >
      (affectionate laugh)
      ((colin_todo_sfx_emotional_laugh_snort))
      _WILD_ amount'a preparation. >
      But there's no use beating yourself up about it. >
      Let's just call it a night,  
      go home,  and... >
      <!>(beat)
      Are... >
      Are you listening?

    Raffles is not listening.

    His eyes are moving between several points in the distance.

    Bunny follows his gaze to the windows on the neighboring building.

    RAFFLES:
      (under his breath)
      ...with the angle of those two...  shouldn't be a problem...  but the third is...

    BUNNY:
      What are you--

    Raffles ((sfx_whoosh_rev_1)) DROPS to one knee and reaches into his overcoat.

    He pulls out ((sfx_bang_collide_nopaper)) a POUCH and opens it flat on the ground.

    Inside are several tools.

    RAFFLES:
      Hold this.

    ((m_todo_sfx_rustle_toolbag))
    Raffles hands Bunny a FLASHLIGHT.

    RAFFLES:
      Don't turn it on until I give the signal.

    BUNNY:
      Wha--

    RAFFLES:
      And this...

    ((m_todo_sfx_rustle_toolbag))
    Raffles hands Bunny a ROPE.

    RAFFLES:
      ...Tie it around your waist.

    BUNNY:
      Um.

    RAFFLES:
      And this...

    ((m_todo_sfx_rustle_toolbag))
    Raffles hands Bunny a CROWBAR.

    RAFFLES:
      ...Put it in--

    Bunny raises a hand --

    BUNNY:
      Woah woah woah.   Wait.   Stop.

    Bunny holds out the equipment for Raffles to take back --

    BUNNY:
      What the hell is happening?

    Raffles dons a MASQUERADE MASK --

    RAFFLES:
      (tying off the mask)
      Really, Bunny...?   
      I thought that'd be quite obvious by now.

    A beat.

    BUNNY:
      Raffles...

    Bunny looks at the mask.   At the rope in his own hands.   At the crowbar.

    BUNNY:
      ...you're a burglar.

    RAFFLES:
      ((colin_todo_emotional_snooty))
      Pfft.   
      Such a vulgar word.

    He holds out a matching mask for Bunny.

    RAFFLES:
      I prefer the term "covert retrieval expert".

    Bunny ((m_todo_sfx_objects_clattering)) drops everything.

    BUNNY:
      ***YOU'RE A FRICKIN' _BURGLAR_!!!***

    Raffles sighs.

    RAFFLES:
      Rather you didn't announce it to the neighborhood... >
      But yes.

    He stands.

    RAFFLES:
      If you insist on calling me such,  
      I am -- in fact -- >
      (distasteful air-quotes)
      "a burglar".

    BUNNY:
      (questioning everything)
      But that means we're--! >
      I-I'm--

    RAFFLES:
      You? >
      (chuckles)
      Oh Bunny...   
      I wouldn't call _you_ a burglar... >
      (tuts)
      One desperate,  late-night affair,  does not a burglar make! >
      <!>(beat)
      Besides...   If one is being *"burgled"* by a burglar... >
      One would think the burglar would _burgle things away_ -- 
      Not burgle them *up the*--

    BUNNY:
      (shaking him)
      ***_COULD'YA QUIT SAYIN' BURGLE_??!!*** >
      IT'S MAKIN' ME INCREDIBLY UNCOMFORTABLE!!

    RAFFLES:
      (laughs)
      Alright, alright... >
      <!>(beat)
      Still you must admit. >
      <!>(smirks)
      You've been remarkably slow on the uptake... >
      Considering the extent of our activities...?

    Bunny backs away --

    BUNNY:
      B-But-- >
      <!>(baffled)
      But you're rich!

    RAFFLES:
      (blinks)
      I am?

    BUNNY [<]:
      I-I've seen your place,  it's--!

    RAFFLES [>]:
      Owned by my family.

    BUNNY [<]:
      Then your family's--

    RAFFLES [>]:
      Cut me off.   >
      Indefinitely,  I'm afraid.

    BUNNY [<]:
      And your job's...?

    RAFFLES [>]:
      Not as financially or intellectually fulfilling as one might think.

    Raffles starts ((m_todo_sfx_rustle_toolbag)) gathering his equipment off the ground --

    RAFFLES:
      (sighs)
      Look Bunny...   
      I can stand here making excuses all night.   But the truth of it is...

    He straightens.

    RAFFLES:
      ((temp_sfx_realization))
      ((play music mus_e_group mute))
      This is what I am.

    He holds the equipment out once again --

    RAFFLES:
      You can either accept it...  or not.

    A beat.

    BUNNY:
      I...

    ((play music mus_e_group mute))
    ((temp_sfx_supershock))
    ((play music mus_e_bass+mus_e_marimba+mus_e_xylophone unmute))
    [[show backdrop bg_danbys_alleyway_turntable]]
    A VINYL RECORD PLAYER ((m_todo_sfx_bang_record_player_crash)) crashes to the ground at their feet.

    RAFFLES:
      (looking up)
      What the--

    Bunny stares at THE WRECKAGE,  stunned.

    The record ((play ambient sfx_amb_record_player_skips_rev_0)) SKIPS over and over.

    _He recognizes the UGLY LOGO_.

    Raffles ((sfx_bang_snatch)) GRABS Bunny's arm and PULLS him under the shelter of the fire escape.

    A FAMILIAR VOICE rings out from above\:

    ATTENDANT (O.S.):
      [[animate stage with shake]]
      ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
      THE HELL IS WRONG WITH YOU??
      THAT WAS EXPENSIVE!!

    A WOMAN'S VOICE (O.S.):
      [[animate stage with shake]]
      ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
      OH NOW he hears me!   NOW his ears work!!!
      MAYBE NOW you'll listen to me for once!!!

    Bunny peeks out from under the fire escape to see a couple arguing in the apartment above.

    It's the PRINT SHOP ATTENDANT and what is -- presumably -- his GIRLFRIEND.

    Raffles peeks up as well --

    RAFFLES:
      Huh.   
      Well this complicates things.

    ((stop music mus_e_group))

    ^: _END ACT THREE_

    -> ACT_FOUR
  end
end

scene ACT_FOUR

  # ActFour

  ^: _ACT FOUR_

  ## Midpoint

  [[show backdrop bg_danbys_alleyway_closeup]]
  ((play music mus_f_group))

  $: EXT. UNDER THE FIRE ESCAPE - LATER THAT NIGHT

  ((play environmental sfx_amb_record_player_skips))
  Bunny is seated on the ground -- hugging his knees.

  Raffles is lying a few feet away -- still wearing his mask -- stretched out on a makeshift bed of cardboard boxes and garbage bags.

  The record continues skipping endlessly as the couple argues above.

  ATTENDANT (O.S.):
    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
    *You are actin' like a CRAZY PERSON!*

  GIRLFRIEND (O.S.):
    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
    *Oh _I'm_ crazy??* >
    (crazily)
    ((colin_todo_sfx_emotional_crazy))
    ::*_I'M_ CrAzY!!??*::

  RAFFLES:
    <!>(bored)
    Doesn't seem like they're winding down any time soon,  does it?

  BUNNY:
    Nope.

  The argument continues in the background as Bunny sits up.

  BUNNY:
    Okay... >
    (turning to him)
    So I thought about it.

  RAFFLES:
    About the chances of their fight ending in murder-suicide? >
    Because I'd say 50/50.   
    Higher,  if he mentions the affair again.

  BUNNY:
    (blinks)
    What?   No,  about the... >
    (mumbles discreetly)
    ..._burglary thing_.

  RAFFLES:
    Oh.

  Raffles gives him an uneasy glance.

  Bunny fidgets with a loose thread.

  BUNNY:
    I thought about it and I decided...

  He straightens and nods --

  BUNNY:
    I decided,  it's fine.

  Raffles blinks.

  Faces him.

  RAFFLES:
    ...Fine?

  BUNNY:
    Yes. >
    (shaking his head)
    Yeah,  it's fine. >
    (looks away with a shrug)
    I mean-- I'm fine with it.

  Raffles gives him a strange look --

  RAFFLES:
    Really?

  BUNNY:
    (looking at him)
    Yes.

  A beat.

  Raffles sits up.

  RAFFLES:
    Oh. >
    (huh.)
    Only--

  He takes off his mask.

  RAFFLES:
    Well,  I hadn't expected this.

  He starts ((sfx_rustle_bag_stow)) digging through his pockets --

  RAFFLES:
    I had this whole speech prepared to--

  BUNNY:
    (laughs)
    Hey come on,  stop that! >
    (grabbing his arm)
    ((sfx_bang_light_bat)) Stop!   Look at me!   It's fine!

  Raffles looks at him.

  BUNNY:
    Look.  I know you,  alright...? >
    <!>(sincerely)
    A.J.,  if you're doing this--  
    If *this* is what you decided you gotta do...   
    Then I'm sure you got your reasons.

  RAFFLES:
    And you...  
    You just _trust_ my reasons are good?

  BUNNY:
    (with a frustrated laugh)
    ((colin_todo_sfx_emotional_laugh_snort)) Yes!

  Raffles holds his gaze.

  RAFFLES:
    ...Why?

  BUNNY:
    (losing it)
    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
    GAH!! >
    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
    'Cause you're my friend, okay?!!

  Bunny gestures between them --

  BUNNY:
    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
    That's what friends do!   >
    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
    _They trust each other_!!

  A beat.

  RAFFLES:
    Bunny...

  Raffles searches his face --

  // ((Mus_F_Bittersweet stop))

  RAFFLES:
    ((stop music mus_f_group))
    We're still friends...?

  Bunny looks at him -- confused by the question.

  He starts to answer --

  ((sfx_bang_drum_kit))
  ((play music mus_g_group mute))
  ((play music mus_g_heel_floor+mus_g_snap_single+mus_g_heel_stage_single+mus_g_belly_1+mus_g_thigh_front unmute))
  _A DRUM KIT CRASHES TO THE GROUND_.

  ATTENDANT (O.S.):
    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
    *Jesus Christ!!!* >
    (yelling)
    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
    *WOULD YOU PLEASE CALM DOWN??*

  Bunny sighs and stands.

  He offers Raffles a hand.

  BUNNY:
    Come on.

  Raffles doesn't notice.

  He's turning his mask over in his hands -- his thoughts a million miles away.

  BUNNY:
    ...Raffles?

  Raffles blinks.   He finally focuses on Bunny's hand...

  . . .

  He takes it.

  Bunny pulls him to his feet.

  BUNNY:
    So what's the plan?

  RAFFLES:
    The plan...?

  BUNNY:
    You _do_ got a plan right?   
    Or were all those fancy gadgets just for show?

  // TODO_r_inquisitive/incredulous
  RAFFLES:
    I'd hardly call a crowbar a gadget.

  BUNNY:
    (eye-roll)
    Okay "tools".   Whatever.   
    What do you need me to do?

  RAFFLES:
    Need _you_ to do?

  BUNNY:
    Raffles... >
    <!>(shutting his eyes tight)
    We've been sitting here listening to _that goddamn record_ repeating for half an hour. >
    Don't you start or I swear to god--

  RAFFLES:
    (taken aback)
    Bunny... >
    Are you saying... _you_...  
    Want to do _crime_...  
    With _me_?

  BUNNY:
    H-Hold on--  
    "Want"'s a strong word.

  RAFFLES:
    But you'd be willing...  
    You'd be my--

  BUNNY:
    <!>(dismissively)
    Yeah yeah-- 
    "accomplice", "partner",  
    "partner-in-crime",
    Whatever, >
    The label doesn't matter. >
    <!>(determined)
    Just tell me what you need,  
    and I'll do it.

  Raffles tilts his head,  recalibrating.

  RAFFLES:
    Well.

  He looks away,  biting a thumbnail --

  RAFFLES:
    (under his breath)
    ...it's certainly a tantalizing offer...

  He turns back and eyes Bunny closely...

  RAFFLES:
    ((colin_todo_sfx_emotional_concerned+temp_sfx_realization))
    ...but you can't do crime.

  BUNNY:
    (blinks)
    Wha-- >
    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
    ((play music mus_g_belly_2+mus_g_chest_hand+mus_g_clap+mus_g_hand_sweep_1+mus_g_hand_sweep_2+mus_g_heel_stage_multi+mus_g_single_hand_clap+mus_g_snap_multi+mus_g_stomp_floor+mus_g_thigh_side unmute))
    Yes I can!!!

  RAFFLES:
    (sighs)
    Bunny...

  BUNNY:
    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
    I can do this!

  RAFFLES:
    <!>(rubbing his temple)
    Bunny...

  BUNNY:
    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
    I can do crime!!

  RAFFLES [<]:
    B--

  BUNNY [>]:
    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
    Would'ya QUIT Bunny-ing me??  
    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
    I REFUSE TO BE 'BUNNY'-ED!!!

  RAFFLES:
    Bunny,  I asked if you wanted to movie hop once and you nearly had a panic attack.

  Bunny gasps.

  BUNNY:
    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
    Only nearly!!

  RAFFLES:
    You cried.

  BUNNY:
    [[animate stage with shake]] ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack)) WOW!!!  [[animate stage with shake]] ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack)) Okay!!   
    [[animate stage with shake]] ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack)) That is *not relevant!*   
    [[animate stage with shake]] ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack)) It was a _sad movie_! >
    (under his breath)
    ...the dog died...

  Raffles looks into his eyes intently.

  A beat.

  Bunny shifts.

  RAFFLES [<]:
    (sighs)
    I don't know...

  BUNNY [>]:
    <!>(exasperated)
    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
    Fine--!

  BUNNY:
    (pacing and thinking)
    Alright...  
    Okay I...  I... >
    (got it!)
    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((colin_sfx_emotional_realization+temp_sfx_smack))
    I did a crime this morning!

  RAFFLES:
    <!>(curious)
    Really?

  BUNNY:
    Yes!   In the subway -- I--I--  
    I jumped the turnstile!

  RAFFLES:
    That's... >
    <!>(disappointed)
    That's not really a _crime_,  is it?

  BUNNY:
    [[animate stage with shake]] ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack)) Yes -- [[animate stage with shake]] ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack)) Yes it is!!

  RAFFLES:
    Was it broken?

  BUNNY:
    What?   [[animate stage with shake]] ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack)) No it wasn't broken!! >
    Also-- also... >
    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
    I stole a scooter!

  RAFFLES:
    <!>(alarmed)
    You stole a child's scooter??

  BUNNY:
    Not a child's--  
    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
    One'a those green ones!!   
    The ones the tourists keep crashin' into people.

  RAFFLES:
    (confused)
    Bunny, you know you're meant to take those, right?

  BUNNY:
    No that's n--   >
    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
    Okay fine!  
    Uhh I...   I...

  Bunny paces back and forth,  racking his brain.

  He stops and ((sfx_bang_snapping_single)) snaps his fingers.

  BUNNY:
    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
    I ran a red light! >
    _Several_ -- red lights.

  RAFFLES:
    Bunny, that's--!

  Raffles steps forward and grabs Bunny's shoulder --

  RAFFLES:
    ...incredibly dangerous... >
    You could have hurt yourself...

  BUNNY:
    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
    Ugh! >
    (shrugging him off)
    Why do you--  
    You always treat me like...  like... >
    ((temp_sfx_smack))
    [[animate stage with shake]] ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack)) GAH!!   
    [[animate stage with shake]] ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack)) *I AIN'T YA _PET_!*   
    [[animate stage with shake]] ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack)) *I AIN'T YA _SIDEKICK_!!* >
    [[animate stage with shake]] ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack)) You don't getta tell me what I can and can't handle, A.J.!!! >
    [[animate stage with shake]] ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack)) ((stop music mus_g_group)) IT'S _MY DECISION_!!  [[animate stage with shake]] ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack)) _NOT YOURS_!!!

  Raffles steps back.

  Bunny stops.   Blinks.   Remembers himself --

  BUNNY:
    Sorry,  I'm sorry... >
    (shutting his eyes)
    I didn't mean-- >
    (shaking his head)
    I just--

  Silence.

  Bunny looks down.   Raffles looks away.

  BUNNY [<]:
    A.J.,  I--

  RAFFLES [>]:
    ((temp_sfx_realization))
    (quietly)
    --You're right.

  Bunny looks at him.

  RAFFLES:
    You're right.   It's your decision. >
    It's not my place to say if you're ready or not.

  // todo_r_sincere

  Raffles holds out Bunny's MASQUERADE MASK.

  // todo_r_sad
  RAFFLES:
