    BUNNY:
      DAMMIT!

    Bunny whirls around and darts to the balcony edge.
    He squints through the rain at the street below.

    No other option.

    Bunny scrambles over the wet railing,  grabs the rope,  and gets his footing on the wall.

    His head SNAPS toward the horizon.

    ((m_todo_sfx_police_sirens))
    _SIRENS in the distance_.

    It's almost dawn,  and the police are coming.

    Bunny looks to the balcony doors.   Still shut tight.

    He looks at the rope.

    ((stop music mus_e_group))
    [[hide backdrop]]
    He closes his eyes.

    ## DarkNightOfTheSoul

    [[animate screen with whitepulse]]
    ((sfx_flashback_transition wait))
    ((queue sound m_todo_sfx_flashback_motif))
    ((stop ambient))
    _FLASHBACK - 5 YEARS AGO_\:  Blackness.

    ((play music mus_j_group_prehook_loop))

    ((sfx_bang_light_bat)) TINK.

    RAFFLES (O.S.):
      Hey.

    ((sfx_bang_light_bat)) TINK.

    RAFFLES (O.S.):
      Hey.   Wake up.

    We see a young Bunny fast asleep,  slumped over the small leather notebook on his desk.

    ((sfx_bang_light_bat)) TINK.   Another Altoid hits him in the face.

    BUNNY:
      (eyes still closed)
      [[animate stage with shake]]
      ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
      Ow!

    Bunny sits up,  rubbing his forehead.

    ((queue music mus_j_group_prehook_end))
    ((queue music mus_j_group_hook))
    ((queue music mus_j_group_main))
    The camera pulls back to reveal...

    [[show backdrop bg_bunnys_dorm_room]]

    $: INT. SAINT SEBASTIAN ACADEMY, BUNNY'S DORM ROOM - DAWN

    Latin Mass and limestone.   Dawn light through stained glass.

    Bunny blearily blinks awake.

    On his desk perches a particularly puckish young chap --

    RAFFLES:
      (eye-roll)
      Ugh...  Finally! >
      (popping a mint in his mouth)
      You were asleep for ages!

    BUNNY:
      (groans)
      ((colin_todo_sfx_emotional_groan)) What time is it?

    RAFFLES:
      Half past five.

    Bunny buries his face in his arms with a muffled moan --

    BUNNY:
      ((colin_todo_sfx_emotional_groan))...whyyyyyy...

    Raffles shrugs.

    RAFFLES:
      (munching)
      Woke up early.   Got bored.

    BUNNY:
      (muffled)
      ...so I gotta suffer too...

    RAFFLES:
      "...A dreamer's punishment is that he sees the dawn before the rest of the world."

    Bunny stares at him.

    // todo bunny suspicious

    BUNNY:
      <!>(deadpan)
      Was that...  _poetry_?

    RAFFLES:
      <!>(smug)
      ((colin_todo_emotional_snooty)) One of my many hidden depths.

    BUNNY:
      ((colin_todo_sfx_emotional_unimpressed))
      Uh-huh. >
      (sitting up)
      So what's so important it couldn't wait til first period?

    RAFFLES:
      I... >
      I-I already said.   
      I was bored.

    BUNNY:
      Nope!   That's a lie. >
      (laughs)
      ((colin_todo_sfx_emotional_laugh_snort))
      That's _definitely_ a lie.

    Raffles huffs and faces the horizon.

    A beat.

    Bunny pushes back from his desk with a ((m_todo_scrape_wood_against_floor)) SCRAPE.

    BUNNY:
      (stands)
      Okay.

    He plods over to his bed.

    BUNNY:
      (lying down)
      Sit there and sulk.

    He pulls up his covers and faces the wall.

    BUNNY (O.S.):
      I'm goin' to sleep.

    The room settles.

    It doesn't last.

    // todo raffles sincere

    RAFFLES:
      You know... >
      (looking out the window)
      ...I'm thinking of attending the reconciliation service.

    Bunny opens an eye.

    // todo bunny suspicious

    BUNNY:
      Seriously?

    RAFFLES:
      (looking at him)
      Hm. >
      <!>(raising an eyebrow)
      Is it really that surprising?

    Bunny turns over to face him.

    Bunny gives him a pointed look.

    // todo raffles swoon

    RAFFLES:
      *Tch*...   You wound me. >
      <!>(theatrically)
      Do I not have a right to *"wash my scarlet sins and make them white as snow"*?

    Bunny sighs and sits up.

    BUNNY:
      Generally the point'a "clean slates" is to try and keep 'em clean.

    RAFFLES:
      Well where's the fun in that?

    // todo suspicious

    BUNNY:
      I don't think _fun_'s all that high on the Catholic agenda.

    RAFFLES:
      (rising)
      I completely disagree.

    He saunters languidly across the sill --

    RAFFLES:
      I take great pleasure in attending Mass.   >
      It satisfies my vanity.

    BUNNY:
      Your vanity.

    RAFFLES:
      <!>(grins)
      Of course!

    Raffles jumps down onto the desk.

    // todo smiling and looking at nails

    RAFFLES:
      Nothing makes a person so vain as being called a sinner. >
      (with a courtly bow)
      It gives religion all the charm of flirtation and romance.

    Bunny gives him a flat look.

    BUNNY:
      You know,  most people would find your views highly offensive.

    RAFFLES:
      (straightens)
      "Most people" have too many virtues and too little imagination.

    BUNNY:
      Not you though.

    RAFFLES:
      (plops down on the windowsill)
      Nope. >
      (crossing his legs)
      I have the opposite problem.

    BUNNY:
      Too little virtue?

    RAFFLES:
      Too much imagination.

    BUNNY:
      Right... >
      (sighs)
      So why *now* all of a sudden?  
      D'you do something you regret?

    RAFFLES:
      Perhaps...

    Raffles turns away.

    RAFFLES:
      ...Perhaps I simply woke with something in my soul I felt I should confess...

    Bunny waits.

    And waits...

    And waits...

    When Raffles turns,  the easy smile is back in place.

    RAFFLES:
      (stands)
      --But!   I've changed my mind.

    Raffles dusts himself off.

    BUNNY:
      great.

    Bunny pulls the covers over his head --

    BUNNY:
      (mumbles)
      Glad we had this chat.

    RAFFLES:
      See you in class.

    He ((sfx_door_hinge_squeak)) opens the window and ((sfx_bang_collide_nopaper)) jumps onto the rooftop.

    RAFFLES:
      (peeking his head in)
      And get some sleep.    >
      You look like crap.

    BUNNY:
      (muffled)
      thanks.

    Bunny hears the ((sfx_door_hinge_squeak)) squeak of the window closing,  but it isn't followed by the usual final click.

    RAFFLES:
      (through the window)
      Hey, Bunny...

    An anxious pause.

    RAFFLES:
      ((colin_todo_sfx_emotional_questioning+temp_sfx_realization))
      ((fade music mus_j_main_extra_hands+mus_j_main_melody to 0 over 0.5))
      (more to himself)
      ...you and me against the world,  yeah?

    A beat.

    Bunny shifts and pokes his head from the covers.

    He looks at him.

    BUNNY:
      Yeah. >
      <!>(beat)
      [[hide backdrop]]
      ((stop music mus_j_group_main))
      You and me against the world.

    _BACK TO SCENE_.

    ((play ambient sfx_amb_rain_outdoors))
    ((play environmental sfx_ambient_alarm_muffled))
    [[show backdrop bg_danbys_balcony_night_bookcase]]

    ## ChoosingActFive

    // TODO_sfx_police_siren
    The ((m_todo_sfx_police_sirens)) sirens are getting closer.

    POLICE LIGHTS in the distance.

    Bunny takes one last look at the street below...

    ((colin_todo_emotional_realization))
    ((play music mus_d_bass_amp+mus_d_bass_di to 7))
    **_...and starts climbing UP_.**

    ^: _END ACT FOUR_

    -> ACT_FIVE
  end
end

scene ACT_FIVE
  ((play ambient sfx_amb_rain_outdoors))
  ((play environmental sfx_ambient_alarm_muffled))
  ((play music mus_d_bass_amp+mus_d_bass_di to 7))
  # ActFive

  ^: _ACT FIVE_

  ## Finale

  $: CLOSEUP - A HAND CLUTCHING THE ROOFTOP EDGE

  Bunny pulls himself onto the roof.

  $: EXT. DANBY'S ROOFTOP - NIGHT

  // todo rain variant

  [[show backdrop bg_danbys_rooftop_dawn]]

  He quickly heads for the skylight.

  It's LOCKED.

  The pouring rain blurs the view below.   He ((sfx_wiping)) wipes away some grime -- and makes out Raffles in the middle of the room.

  ((m_todo_sfx_door_open+temp_sfx_dooropens))
  ((play ambient sfx_amb_rain_indoors))
  ((play environmental sfx_ambient_alarm))
  ((stop music mus_d_bass_amp+mus_d_bass_di))
  [[hide backdrop]]
  The office door swings open.

  $: INT./EXT. INTERCUT

  [[show backdrop bg_danbys_office_dawn]]

  ((stop environmental))
  The alarm STOPS.

  RAFFLES:
    Ah!   Good old Danby!   
    What a surprise.   
    It's been a while,  hasn't it?

  A sharply-dressed figure steps into the room.

  ((sfx_door_close))
  ((play music mus_k_group))
  The door shuts.

  A _woman_.

  This is DANBY (26).  She's only three years older than Raffles.  But she wears it like decades.

  DANBY:
    I hate it when you call me that.

  RAFFLES:
    <!>(smiling)
    I know.

  DANBY:
    What are you doing here, Arthur?

  RAFFLES:
    Oof. >
    What kind of greeting is that for an old friend?

  DANBY:
    The kind he deserves.

  [[hide backdrop]]
  [[show backdrop bg_danbys_rooftop_dawn]]
  ((play ambient sfx_amb_rain_outdoors))
  ((sfx_tires_screech_rev_1))
  A SCREECH of tires.

  Bunny looks up to see two officers ((sfx_car_doors_open_close_distant)) exit a police car and approach the building.

  Danby and Raffles' voices emanate through the skylight from the room below -- too muffled to make out through the rain.

  Bunny ducks lower on the roof.

  [[hide backdrop]]
  [[show backdrop bg_danbys_office_dawn]]
  ((play ambient sfx_amb_rain_indoors))

  RAFFLES:
    (glancing toward the window)
    ((colin_todo_sfx_emotional_sigh)) Well I really wish I could stay and enjoy more of your lovely hospitality >
    But it seems you'll be entertaining other guests soon. >
    I'll just say my piece and be on my way.

  Raffles ((sfx_paper_unfurl)) pulls out the STACK OF SCRIPTS from his coat and ((sfx_paper_crunch_rev_0)) tosses them on the desk --

  RAFFLES:
    ((temp_sfx_thud3))
    ((fade music mus_k_bass_clarinet+mus_k_clarinet+mus_k_tenor_sax+mus_k_viola+mus_k_violin_1+mus_k_violin_1+mus_k_violin_2_3+mus_k_violin_2_1+mus_k_violin_2_2 to 0 over 0.5))
    Stop sending me these.   
    I'm not interested in joining your crew.

  Danby raises an eyebrow.

  She picks up the scripts and flips through them.

  DANBY:
    A shame.

  RAFFLES:
    I know,  I know.

  DANBY:
    These were some of my best.

  RAFFLES:
    All marvels of ingenuity,  I'm sure.

  DANBY:
    ((colin_todo_emotional_realization+temp_sfx_realization))
    ((fade music mus_k_bass_clarinet+mus_k_clarinet+mus_k_tenor_sax+mus_k_viola+mus_k_violin_1+mus_k_violin_1+mus_k_violin_2_3+mus_k_violin_2_1+mus_k_violin_2_2 to 1 over 5))
    But I didn't send them.

  Silence.

  RAFFLES:
    What?

  DANBY:
    Always so full of yourself,  aren't you?

  She ((sfx_bang_light_bat)) tosses them in a WASTE BIN.

  // todo danby eyes closed

  DANBY:
    I don't want you on the team, Arthur. >
    Considering that little _stunt_ you pulled five years ago.

  [[animate screen with whitepulse]]
  ((sfx_flashback_transition wait))
  ((queue sound m_todo_sfx_flashback_motif))
  _INSERT - 5 YEARS AGO:_  A young Danby,  struggling,  being dragged father and farther away.   "LET HER GO!"    Hands tremble around a gun.   *His* hands.   An ace of spades.   _A stampede_.

  [[animate screen with whitepulse]]
  ((sfx_flashback_transition))
  _BACK TO SCENE_.

  Raffles goes very still.

  RAFFLES:
    I-I don't-- >
    If you didn't send them,  then who...

  DANBY:
    Take a wild guess.

  [[animate screen with whitepulse]]
  ((sfx_flashback_transition wait))
  ((queue sound m_todo_sfx_flashback_motif))
  _INSERT - 5 YEARS AGO:_  *A girl's* hands,  wrenching the gun from his.   "What are you doing?!"   ((sfx_guns_firing)) **BA-BANG** -- A scream.   *Blood* drips down the side of her face.

  [[animate screen with whitepulse]]
  ((sfx_flashback_transition))
  _BACK TO SCENE_.

  RAFFLES:
    <!>(thrown)
    But--

  Danby picks the FRAMED PHOTO off the floor.

  DANBY:
    I always did underestimate the effect you have on her.

  In the photo\:  three young kids -- Raffles,  Danby,  and *the girl* between them,  an arm slung around each.

  She ((sfx_bang_light_bat)) stands the photo back on her desk.

  DANBY:
    But that's love.   Makes fools of us all.

  Raffles steps back.

  %: CUT TO:

  $: INTERIOR STAIRCASE - TWO FIGURES THUNDER UP THE STEPS.

  A gloved fist ((sfx_bang_wood_thump)) pounds the office door.

  ((sfx_bang_wood_thump wait)) THUD. ((sfx_bang_wood_thump after 0.25)) THUD.

  FROM THE OTHER SIDE of the door --

  DETECTIVE MACKENZIE (O.S.):
    (muffled)
    Police!   Open up!

  Raffles flinches.   The room comes back to him.   Too late.

  Raffles WHIPS toward the balcony.

  _It's still blocked off_.

  ((sfx_door_slam_open_rev_0))
  ((stop music mus_k_group))
  BANG!   The door SLAMS open.

  Two officers enter,  one pointing a gun at Raffles' back.

  OFFICER CRAWSHAY:
    H-hands in the air!

  A beat.

  For a second,  no one moves...

  Then Raffles slowly puts his hands up.

  DETECTIVE MACKENZIE:
    On the ground, please.

  A beat.

  Raffles slowly kneels.

  Crawshay inches forward --

  OFFICER CRAWSHAY:
    N-No sudden movements!

  Raffles slowly puts his hands behind his head and bows forward.

  Crawshay takes one hand off the gun to fumble with something on his belt -- HANDCUFFS.

  He takes one more step forward and...

  ((sfx_window_smash))
  ((play music mus_d_group to 5))
  [[show backdrop bg_danbys_office_dawn_broken_glass]]
  CRASH.  _A BRICK FALLS AMIDST A SHIMMERING SHOWER OF GLASS_.   It knocks away THE GUN.

  BUNNY PLUNGES THROUGH THE NOW SHATTERED SKYLIGHT,  shielding himself from the shards with his jacket and ((sfx_whoosh_rev_1)) tossing it over the head of the disoriented police officer.

  ((sfx_bang_collide_nopaper)) Bunny lands,  ((sfx_bang_body_on_couch_slow after 0.25)) rolls,  and ((sfx_bang_light_bat after 0.75)) swipes the gun off the floor.

  The officer struggles to pull the wet jacket off.

  Bunny POINTS THE GUN --

  BUNNY:
    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
    NOBODY FUCKIN' MOVE!

  Mackenzie stands still.   Danby sits up.   Crawshay wrenches the jacket away and holds up both hands.

  Bunny ((sfx_glass_crunch)) steps back.   He's wearing a SKI MASK.

  Raffles starts to turn toward him,  but Bunny ((sfx_bang_kick)) kicks his foot --

  // todo bunny gun, eye looking to the side

  BUNNY:
    You too!

  Raffles snaps back forward.

  With one hand still aiming the gun,  Bunny uses his other to ((sfx_bang_snatch)) peel his jacket off the floor and ((sfx_rustle_bag_stow)) stuff it in his bag.   He returns both hands to the gun.

  He steps back toward the bookshelf blocking the balcony door.

  Once he's in view of Raffles,  he makes eye contact,  and nods toward the bookshelf.

  Raffles stands slowly.

  Detective Mackenzie steps forward,  but Bunny trains the gun on her --

  BUNNY:
    I SAID DON'T MOVE!

  She freezes.

  Without turning,  Raffles approaches the heavy bookshelf,  grabs the edge,  and ((m_todo_scrape_wood_against_floor)) drags it out of the way.[[show backdrop bg_danbys_office_dawn_bookcase_returned]]

  He unlocks the balcony doors and ((m_todo_sfx_door_open)) swings them open.

  BUNNY:
    (to Raffles, still facing the officers)
    Go on.

  Raffles hesitates.

  BUNNY:
    (over his shoulder, under his breath)
    I'll be all right.

  A beat.

  Raffles steps through the doors.

  Bunny positions himself between Raffles and the officers.

  BUNNY:
    Don't follow us.

  ((temp_sfx_realization))
  ((fade music mus_d_soprano_sax+mus_d_tenor_sax+mus_d_trombone+mus_d_trumpet_1+mus_d_trumpet_2+mus_d_trumpet_3+mus_d_alto_sax+mus_d_bari_sax+mus_d_violas_leg+mus_d_violas_run+mus_d_violins_1_leg+mus_d_violins_1_run+mus_d_violins_2_leg to 0 over 0.5))
  Danby laughs,  once.

  Bunny's gun swings to her -- trembling.

  DANBY:
    Look at you. >
    You have _no idea_ what you're doing,  do you?

  BUNNY:
    Wh--

  She keeps her eyes on Bunny and nods her head toward the officers --

  DANBY:
    ((temp_sfx_lightbulb))
    ((fade music mus_d_digital_piano+mus_d_e_piano+mus_d_guitar+mus_d_guitar_wah+mus_d_harp_run+mus_d_organ to 0 over 0.5))
    You really think they wouldn't have called for backup by now?

  Bunny's gun jerks back to the officers.

  A ((sfx_tires_screech)) SCREECH of tires.   Blue-and-whites pull up across the street.

  DANBY:
    ((temp_sfx_realization))
    ((fade music mus_d_bongos+mus_d_congas+mus_d_cymbal+mus_d_drums to 0 over 0.5))
    Better run,  little rabbit.

  Raffles PULLS Bunny through the door,  ((sfx_door_close)) SLAMS IT,  and ((sfx_sliding_metal_against_metal)) slides his CROWBAR through the handles to bar it closed.

  [[hide backdrop]]

  $: EXT. DANBY'S OFFICE BALCONY

  [[show backdrop bg_danbys_balcony_dawn_crowbar]]

  Raffles grabs the rope hanging from the roof and ((sfx_rustle_harness)) clips a RAPPELLING DEVICE onto it.

  Quickly,  HE ((sfx_bang_body_on_couch_slow)) LIFTS BUNNY and THROWS HIM OVER HIS SHOULDER INTO A FIREMAN'S CARRY.

  He jumps the railing,  grabs the device,  and -- with Bunny on his shoulder -- ((sfx_rappelling)) SLIDES ALL THE WAY DOWN TO THE ALLEY BELOW.

  [[hide backdrop]]
  ((stop music mus_d_group))

  $: EXT. RAINY ALLEYWAY

  [[show backdrop bg_danbys_alleyway_mirrored]]

  ((play music mus_a_group mute))
  ((play music mus_a_claves+mus_a_wood_block unmute))

  Once they ((sfx_bang_body_on_couch_slow)) touch solid ground,  Raffles lowers Bunny for just a moment.   Then scoops him back up in a great whirling hug --

  RAFFLES:
    [[animate stage with shake]] ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack)) BUNNY!  THAT WAS *BRILLIANT!*   
    [[animate stage with shake]] ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack)) You were incredible~!!

  Raffles sets him down again.

  Bunny turns away.

  RAFFLES:
    Bunny?

  Bunny vomits in a trashcan.

  RAFFLES:
    ((colin_todo_sfx_emotional_queasy)) Oof.   
    We'll work on the dismount next time.

  BUNNY:
    (stands, shaky - pulling off his ski mask)
    [[animate stage with shake]] ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack)) N-No!   [[animate stage with shake]] ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack)) No next time! >
    ((temp_sfx_smack))
    (clutching his hair)
    [[animate stage with shake]] ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack)) JESUS CHRIST!  [[animate stage with shake]] ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack)) _I JUST ASSAULTED A GODDAMN POLICE OFFICER!!_

  The ((sfx_running_multiple_down_stairs_rev_1 to 2)) sound of FOOTFALLS.   Getting closer.

  RAFFLES:
    (looking toward the sound)
    Yes...  maybe not the best place for a confession. >
    (grabbing Bunny's hand)
    Come on!

  ((stop music mus_a_group))

  [[hide backdrop]]

  [[show backdrop bg_danbys_nieghborhood_side_street]]

  ((play music mus_a_group))
  Raffles drags Bunny around the corner and down a narrow side street.

  He ((sfx_leaves_rustle_rev_1)) dives into a nearby hedge and yanks Bunny down with him.

  Several officers ((sfx_running)) run by with flashlights.

  Bunny tugs on Raffles' sleeve --

  BUNNY:
    (whispering)
    *What now??*

  Raffles' eyes dart around the block\:

  A LOW BUILDING across the street.

  A STACK OF WOODEN PALLETS against a wall.

  A FLICKERING LAMP POST nearby.

  He looks at the LAMP POST DIRECTLY ABOVE and follows the post down to its base in the dirt.

  He ((sfx_bang_body_on_couch_slow)) rolls toward it,  ((m_todo_sfx_rustle_toolbag)) pulls out a SMALL MULTI-TOOL from his pocket,  ((sfx_bang_light_bat)) flips out a screwdriver,  and starts unscrewing a panel on the base.

  RAFFLES:
    (nods towards the pallets)
    That's our escape route.   
    I'll need your help to reach it. >
    (opens the panel)
    Remember the signal from the security room?

  BUNNY:
    *Yeah?  Why?*

  Raffles reaches inside the panel and ((sfx_bang_light_bat)) flicks off the circuit breaker.   The lamp goes DARK.

  RAFFLES:
    Same principle.   
    But we won't be using sound this time.

  He ((sfx_bang_light_bat)) flicks it back on.   The lamp LIGHTS UP.

  RAFFLES:
    (taking off his gloves)
    Twice for stop.  Once for go.   
    Got it?

  He holds out his GLOVES --

  RAFFLES:
    Insulated,  should keep you safe.

  // todo bunny gloves

  BUNNY:
    (whispers, putting on the gloves)
    *Really hope your glove guy's different than your rope guy*.

  RAFFLES:
    Ready? >
    3.   2.   1.

  [[hide backdrop]]
  ((stop music mus_a_group))

  _THE BEAT DROPS_.

  ### RhythmMinigame5

  ^: <!>=== RHYTHM FINALE REMIX BEGINS ===

  ^: <!>[GAMEPLAY\: Tap twice for stop,  Tap once for go]

  $: EXT. BUSHES / RAINY STREET - (MINIGAME 5A)

  _SPLITSCREEN_ between Bunny and Raffles.

  _On the left_,  Bunny signals when an officer is nearby.

  _On the right_,  Raffles ducks behind cars and dumpsters as he makes his way across the street.

  Raffles reaches the pallets and grabs one off the top of the stack.

  _END SPLITSCREEN_

  He flips the pallet vertically and sets it down against the wall with a loud THUNK --

  RAFFLES:
    (shouts to Bunny)
    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
    Now!

  An officer shines a light on Raffles --

  POLICE OFFICER:
    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
    Hey!

  Bunny bolts across the street.   He shoves the officer as he passes,  knocking him to the ground --

  // todo bunny gloves

  BUNNY:
    Sorry!

  Raffles climbs up the pallet onto the roof.

  Bunny clambers after.

  Raffles grabs his hand and pulls him up.

  RAFFLES:
    Follow my lead!

  $: EXT. ROOFTOPS - (MINIGAME 5B)

  ^: <!>[GAMEPLAY\: Swipe left to move left,  Swipe right to move right]

  Raffles runs across the rooftops -- Ducks.   Dives.   Railings,  banisters,  vents -- with Bunny trailing close behind.

  Finally they see it...

  $: EXT. THE ALBANY ROOFTOP - (MINIGAME 5C)

  Raffles makes it to The Albany roof,  but just as Bunny jumps across the last gap,  his foot SLIPS.

  He careens backwards  .  .  .  falling until  .  .  .

  Raffles catches his hand and wraps an arm around his waist.

  He pulls him close.

  Face to face.

  A door BANGS OPEN below.

  Looking over the ledge,  they see an old lady step out onto her balcony.

  She hums and waters the plants along her railing,  then steps back inside.

  Raffles releases Bunny.

  RAFFLES:
    Hold that thought for later.

  Raffles swings down to the balcony below and motions for Bunny to do the same.

  ^: <!>[GAMEPLAY\: Tap-and-hold to stop,  Release to go]

  The boys climb down The Albany,  jumping from each balcony to the one below,  and ducking to the left and right of the doors whenever someone inside looks out.

  They finally make it to Raffles' balcony.

  Raffles wobbles on the railing,  but Bunny catches his arm and pulls him back.

  With their combined weight,  they ((sfx_door_slam_open_rev_0)) BURST backward through the balcony doors.

  ^: <!>=== RHYTHM FINALE REMIX ENDS ===

  $: INT. RAFFLES' KITCHEN - DAWN

  [[show backdrop bg_raffles_int_apartment_dawn with pan_left]]

  The boys ((sfx_bang_collide_nopaper)) land in a heap on the floor.

  Bunny ((sfx_bang_body_on_couch_slow)) rolls off.   They lie shell-shocked,  side-by-side,  staring up at the ceiling and struggling to catch their breath.

  choose
    + [Success!]
      _If the player did well:_  A laugh explodes out of Bunny's lungs -- one ragged,  filthy bark.

    + [Fail...]
      _If the player did poorly:_  Bunny exhales shakily.   An illicit thrill bubbling under the surface.
  then

    BUNNY:
      (removing his mask)
      Holy shit. >
      (turns his head to face Raffles)
      I can't believe we just did that.

    ((temp_sfx_smack))
    ((play music mus_e_group mute))
    ((play music mus_e_bass+mus_e_marimba+mus_e_xylophone unmute))
    Bunny BOLTS UPRIGHT --

    BUNNY:
      [[animate stage with shake]]
      ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
      What about the script??

    RAFFLES:
      The script?

    BUNNY:
      (turning to him)
      [[animate stage with shake]] ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack)) The script!   [[animate stage with shake]] ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack)) _MY_ script!!   
      [[animate stage with shake]] ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack)) It's got my name on it!

    RAFFLES:
      (sitting up)
      Yes...?   Same as every writer who submitted one.

    Bunny LEAPS UP --

    BUNNY:
      [[animate stage with shake]]
      ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
      But what if they suspect me??

    Raffles rises to his feet.

    RAFFLES:
      (untying his own mask)
      What if they suspect a screenwriter broke into someone's home,  trashed their office,  and assaulted an officer of the law -- >
      -- just so they could get a job at the victim's studio...?

    Raffles dangles the mask from one finger,  weighing nothing.

    RAFFLES:
      Well I'd certainly applaud their imagination.

    BUNNY:
      (pacing, manic)
      [[animate stage with shake]]
      ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
      But they saw me!

    RAFFLES:
      They saw someone in a ski mask.

    BUNNY:
      [[animate stage with shake]]
      ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
      They saw _you_!

    RAFFLES:
      (eyes following him)
      My back. >
      I don't believe it's particularly memorable. >
      <!>(smirks)
      ((colin_todo_emotional_flirty))
      Though I'm flattered you disagree.

    [[hide backdrop]]
    [[show backdrop bg_raffles_int_apartment_dawn with pan_right]]

    Bunny starts in on him--

    Then blinks.

    BUNNY:
      (hold on a fucking second)
      You locked me out!!

    RAFFLES:
      To keep you safe.

    BUNNY:
      _Me_ safe???
      [[animate stage with shake]]
      ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
      YOU COULDA DIED,  DIPSHIT!!!!!

    He could have died.

    Something in Bunny short-circuits --

    BUNNY:
      ((fade music mus_e_bass+mus_e_marimba+mus_e_xylophone to 0 over 0.5))
      Kiss me.

    RAFFLES:
      What?

    [[animate stage with shake]]
    ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
    ((fade music mus_e_bass+mus_e_marimba+mus_e_xylophone to 1 over 0.5))
    Bunny KISSES HIM.   Raffles steps back,  ((sfx_bang_wood_thump)) bumping against the coffee table.

    RAFFLES:
      Do you want to talk about this?

    BUNNY:
      No.

    Bunny ((sfx_bang_body_on_couch_slow)) pushes him down on the coffee table.

    RAFFLES:
      (muffled against Bunny's mouth)
      I really think we should--

    Bunny deepens the kiss.

    Raffles makes a noise.   Bunny pulls away.

    BUNNY:
      [[animate stage with shake]]
      ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
      What??!

    RAFFLES:
      It's just-- >
      You're still a bit-- >
      ((colin_todo_sfx_emotional_queasy))
      ...vomity?

    A beat.

    ((temp_sfx_stab))
    Bunny DARTS into the bathroom and returns FRANTICALLY BRUSHING his teeth --

    BUNNY:
      (mumbling around the brush)
      What if they find the trashcan?

    RAFFLES:
      --Is that my toothbrush?

    BUNNY:
      (pacing, still brushing)
      [[animate stage with shake]]
      ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
      I threw up in a trashcan!!  
      [[animate stage with shake]]
      ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
      What if they find it?!?!?

    [[hide backdrop]]
    [[show backdrop bg_raffles_int_apartment_dawn with pan_left]]

    Bunny DASHES to the kitchen.

    RAFFLES:
      (hesitantly approaching the kitchen)
      Wouldn't have DNA. ...I don't think?

    Bunny ((sfx_spitting_sink)) SPITS OUT in the sink.

    He TURNS to Raffles,  but Raffles stops him --

    RAFFLES:
      Woah woah woah.   
      I don't wanna kiss you while you're freaking out.

    BUNNY:
      Really?

    RAFFLES:
      ... >
      <p:1>No I still do. >
      <p:1>But for god's sake, Bunny. >
      <p:2>Pull yourself together.

    Raffles KISSES HIM and backs him into the counter.

    ((colin_todo_emotional_realization+temp_sfx_realization))
    Bunny gasps.

    RAFFLES:
      Is that a...?

    BUNNY:
      Don't you say it.   
      _Don't you fuckin' dare_...

    Bunny pulls THE GUN out of his pocket and ((sfx_bang_set_on_counter)) SLAMS it on the countertop.

    He doesn't let go.

    He starts hyperventilating.

    RAFFLES:
      <!>(confused)
      Um. >
      What... >
      ...What's happening?

    BUNNY:
      <!>(eyes shut tight)
      P-panic attack.

    RAFFLES:
      <!>(alarmed)
      Oh--! >
      (approaching)
      W-what should I...?

    BUNNY:
      [[animate stage with shake]]
      ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
      Nothing!! >
      (between wheezes)
      Stay -- over there.

    Bunny flaps a hand at him -- the one with the loaded weapon.

    Raffles blinks.  Carefully,  he plucks the gun out of Bunny's grasp.

    His eyes never leave Bunny.   \
    Below,  his hands work on muscle memory\:

    The mag clicks free.   The slide snaps back.   The loaded round drops into his palm.

    All of it disappears into his own back pocket.

    He waits.

    Hovering.

    Anxious...

    BUNNY:
      [[animate stage with shake]]
      ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
      Fine!! >
      (wheezing)
      Just-- Just talk to me.

    RAFFLES:
      About?

    BUNNY:
      (shaking his head)
      [[animate stage with shake]]
      ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
      Anything!!

    RAFFLES:
      O-okay!  I-- Well I--I-- I can't think of anything in particular...

    BUNNY:
      [[animate stage with shake]]
      ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
      _NOW_ you don't feel like talking??

    RAFFLES:
      [[animate stage with shake]]
      ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
      You're putting me on the spot!!! >
      (quickly)
      Okay so one time I was stealing this--

    BUNNY:
      [[animate stage with shake]]
      ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
      --NOT ABOUT CRIME!!!

    RAFFLES:
      [[animate stage with shake]]
      ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
      WELL THAT SERIOUSLY LIMITS MY ANECDOTES!!!

    Bunny crouches down,  clutching his chest.

    RAFFLES:
      (kneeling next to him)
      Okay...  okay... >
      Remember when we were at school?

    Bunny groans and leans his head against the counter --

    BUNNY:
      I got anxiety... not amnesia--

    RAFFLES:
      [[animate stage with shake]]
      ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
      Let me finish! >
      Remember when we were at school -- in the dining hall -- >
      And-And I stole your flan -- And you threatened to report me to campus police -- And *I* said... >
      "What're they gonna do?   
      *Take me into _custardy_?*"

    A beat.

    RAFFLES:
      [[raffles_shy]]
      (apprehensive chuckle)
      ((colin_todo_emotional_embarrassed+temp_sfx_whoops))
      ((stop music mus_e_group))
      Y-You know,  "custard-y"? >
      [[raffles_unsure]]
      (pause)
      ...Ha!

    Silence.

    BUNNY:
      ((colin_todo_sfx_emotional_sigh+temp_sfx_whoops))
      (through a wheeze)
      You're awful at this.

    // Once we have more drum stems, just play drums from panic
    ((play music mus_f_group mute))
    ((play music mus_f_drums unmute to 3))

    Bunny stands shakily,  steadying himself on the counter.   His breathing starts to calm down.

    Raffles ((sfx_bang_body_on_couch_slow)) slumps to the floor,  leaning his head against the counter and looking up at Bunny --

    RAFFLES:
      Please never do that again. >
      I don't think my heart can take it.

    BUNNY:
      Yeah...  I'll go ahead and forward that request to my brain.

    A beat.

    RAFFLES:
      So...

    BUNNY:
      Yes?

    RAFFLES:
      Are we going to discuss the fact that we...

    BUNNY:
      Nope nononono no.   Naaaahhh...   
      Let's not.

    RAFFLES:
      Right.

    Silence.

    Raffles stands.

    RAFFLES:
      Well.   As I mentioned before,  
      I do have a spare room.

    He makes his way across the kitchen --

    RAFFLES [<]:
      My offer still stands.   Though I understand if you'd rather--

    BUNNY [>]:
      ((temp_sfx_lightbulb))
      ((fade music mus_f_drums to 0 over 0.5))
      --Can I sleep with you?

    <!>Raffles freezes.

    BUNNY:
      ((fade music mus_f_drums to 1 over 0.5))
      --Just sleep! >
      In your room.   I just--  
      ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_modest_embarrassed)) I-I really don't wanna be alone right now. >
      [[animate stage with shake]]
      ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
      And I'm very quiet!  
      I don't even snore anymore--

    RAFFLES:
      Bunny, I...

    BUNNY:
      --Alright,  that's a lie. >
      [[animate stage with shake]]
      ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
      But not super loudly! >
      I promise you won't even notice I'm there--

    RAFFLES:
      I don't think that's...

    BUNNY:
      --I could sleep on the floor, if you wa--

    RAFFLES:
      [[animate stage with shake]]
      ((m_todo_sfx_emotional_yelling+temp_sfx_smack))
      NO!

    Raffles pinches the bridge of his nose --

    RAFFLES:
      Don't be ridiculous.

    Bunny lowers his head.

    RAFFLES:
      _I'll_ sleep on the floor.

    Bunny looks up.

    RAFFLES:
      (eyeing him)
      You're lucky I kept my earplugs.

    [[hide backdrop]]

    %: CUT TO:

    $: INT. RAFFLES' BEDROOM - A BIT LATER

    [[show backdrop bg_raffles_loft_lamp]]
    ((play music mus_f_group to 2))

    Bunny -- wearing pajamas that are a size too long -- lies in the center of Raffles' massive bed,  staring up at the ceiling.

    On the floor next to him,  Raffles lies quietly on an impractically thin spare mattress.

    Raffles sits up and reaches toward the lamp on his nightstand.   But before he can switch it off--

    BUNNY:
      A.J.?

    He lets go of the lamp cord.

    RAFFLES:
      Yes?

    BUNNY:
      What...  
      What do I tell my mom...?

    A beat.

    Raffles lies back down.

    RAFFLES:
      The truth,  I suppose.

    Bunny turns toward Raffles.

    BUNNY:
      The truth would--

    RAFFLES:
      (facing him)
      --kill her? >
      Yes,  yes.  
      You've said many times.   
      Trust me... >
      (pointed look)
      I know.

    BUNNY:
      (groans)
      But you don't understand--  
      You've never met my family.

    RAFFLES:
      No...   
      You did make sure of that,  
      didn't you?

    Silence.

    BUNNY:
      I--

    RAFFLES:
      --Look.

    Raffles sighs and faces the ceiling.

    RAFFLES:
      You don't have to tell her _everything_.   
      Not all at once. >
      But maybe start with the truth about your career? >
      She may not change her mind completely,  but--

    BUNNY:
      --She won't.   Trust me,  she-- >
      (sighs)
      _People don't change_.   
      They just don't.

    RAFFLES:
      No,  people don't change...

    Raffles faces him.

    RAFFLES:
      ((temp_sfx_lightbulb))
      But they _do_ develop...

    A beat.

    Bunny considers this...

    He looks at his phone charging beneath the nightstand lamp.

    1 New Message\:

    \    **(Maria Manders)\:**
    \    **Did you get the job?**

    He considers.

    He faces the ceiling again.

    BUNNY:
      (closing his eyes)
      I'll think about it.

    Raffles ((sfx_bang_light_bat)) shuts off the lamp.[[show backdrop bg_raffles_loft_dim]]

    RAFFLES:
      Good night, Bunny.

    And while the two of them settle into this fragile darkness...

    ...Bunny opens his eyes and continues to stare at the ceiling.

    ...Raffles' gaze drifts back to a glint under the nightstand.

    _The gun_.

    [[hide backdrop]]

    We pan out further and further,  out the Albany window,  up into the early morning sky,  and down to...

    ((stop ambient))
    ((stop music mus_f_group))

    ## FinalImage

    $: EXT. DANBY'S RESIDENCE - MORNING

    [[show backdrop bg_danbys_ext_townhouse_wide_morning]]

    ((play ambient sfx_ambient_city_streets_night))
    ((play music mus_h_group mute))
    ((play music mus_h_bass+mus_h_drums+mus_h_snap unmute))

    Several police cars are parked out front.
    Lights flashing.

    An officer blocks off the entrance with caution tape,
    as another ((sfx_bang_light_bat)) takes a photo of the smashed window.

    Someone's being interviewed on the doorstep.

    It's Danby -- leaning against the doorframe -- casually giving a statement to the police.

    The officer nods politely,  flips their notepad closed,  and makes their way inside.

    As they pass,  we catch a brief glimpse of Danby holding a RED CRICKET BALL behind her back.

    She ((sfx_rustle_bag_stow)) hides it in her pocket.

    [[hide backdrop]]

    [[show backdrop bg_danbys_int_foyer_morning]]

    The officer approaches a detective in a high-collared trench coat.

    The two of them make their way through the residence --

    OFFICER CRAWSHAY:
      The victim says she didn't get a good look at the thieves.   She's got no theories as to who they might be. >
      We got a few officers examinin' the points of entry,  but whoever these guys were,  they were thorough. >
      Aside from a few tools,  there's no trace of 'em.

    [[hide backdrop]]

    [[show backdrop bg_danbys_office_morning]]

    The two investigators enter the office and stop.

    We don't see the detective's face,  but they don't appear to be listening.

    OFFICER CRAWSHAY:
      Boss?

    She moves through the room.  Slow.  Searching...

    She eyes the shattered vase.  Toes the shards.

    She works her way to the desk.  Lifts the cracked photo frame.  Turns it over.

    Nothing.

    She kneels.  Checks under the desk.

    Something in the dark.

    A small CARD.

    OFFICER CRAWSHAY:
      (trying to get a closer look)
      What's that?

    She doesn't answer.

    She just looks at it.

    She hoped she wouldn't find it.

    Then,  she stands.

    DETECTIVE MACKENZIE:
      (walking and talking)
      I want tape from this neighborhood -- 8 to 6. >
      If there's been any recent thefts or break-ins in the city,  I want to know -- don't care how small. >
      Everything comes to me.

    OFFICER CRAWSHAY:
      (trailing after)
      Sorry but...  what's goin' on?

    Mackenzie keeps walking.

    ((stop music)) We don't follow her.

    $: CLOSEUP - AN ACE OF SPADES PLAYING CARD

    Old ink.   Schoolboy handwriting.   A theatrical "*T*".

    Three words scrawled across it.   Clear,  at last\:

    \    **The Phantom Thieves**

    [[hide backdrop]]

    -> ENDING_CREDITS
  end
end

scene ENDING_CREDITS
  ((play music mus_credits_group))
  ^:
    ENDING CREDITS SEQUENCE:
    _THE ADVENTURES OF A.J. RAFFLES (& BUNNY)_
    ~
  [An animated walking sequence of a black cat strutting confidently while a white bunny nervously hops after it.   A boppy,  electro-swing beat plays in time to their stride.]

  The music ends on an ominous note as we see a photograph of a BROKEN LOCKPICK,  entered into evidence\:

  \    **People's Exhibit No. 1**

